{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22028","headline":"和荅诗十首 和古社 · 白居易","name":"和荅诗十首 和古社","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"废村多年树，生在古社隈。\n爲作妖狐窟，心空身未摧。\n妖狐变美女，社树成楼台。\n黄昏行人过，见者心裴回。\n饥鵰竟不捉，老犬反爲媒。\n岁媚少年客，十去九不回。\n昨夜云雨合，烈风驱迅雷。\n风拔树根出，雷劈社坛开。\n飞电化爲火，妖狐烧作灰。\n天明至其所，清旷无氛埃。\n旧地葺村落，新田辟荒莱。\n始知天降火，不必常爲灾。\n勿谓神默默，勿谓天恢恢。\n勿喜犬不捕，勿夸鵰不猜。\n寄言狐媚者，天火有时来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22028.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22028","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}